#%PAM-1.0
# Session stack for athanor-recovery.service. systemd runs only the account and session
# phases for PAMName=; the kiosk never authenticates anyone. pam_systemd is required: the
# logind session on the VT is what hands cosmic-comp the display and the input devices.
account         required pam_unix.so
session         required pam_unix.so
session         required pam_systemd.so
